SUMMARY:A Well-Advised Lunch: Careers Through Competitions with Marissa M
 oore\, CEO of Piano Cleveland
DESCRIPTION:Students\, sign-up here &gt\;Piano Cleveland has redesigned t
 he Cleveland International Piano Competition around what a pianists' care
 er requires today: building compelling programs\, collaborating at a prof
 essional level\, communicating directly with an audience\, and showcasing
  a unique artistic identity. In this session\, Marissa Moore\, CEO of Pia
 no Cleveland walks through what's changing for 2027 — new collaborative
  formats\, an expanded Artist Development Program\, and a prize structure
  that rewards contestants well beyond the finalists — and shares qualit
 ies that set standout candidates apart throughout all stages of the compe
 tition.
